": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can buy many arts and crafts at the festival.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le07ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "bazaar ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an area where there are a lot of small shops ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is a bazaar where you can buy many things.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le07ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "bevy ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large group of things ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is a bevy of yummy food options.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le07ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn4le07ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Prepositions of Place", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the preposition <span class=\"strong\">in</span> to show that something is enclosed.<br/><br/>You use the preposition <span class = \"strong\">at</span>  to show position within land-areas.<br/><br/>You use the preposition  <span class = \"strong\">on</span> to show a position on a horizontal or vertical surface.<br/><br/>You use the preposition <span class = \"strong\">across</span> to show movement along or through something.<br/><br/>You use the preposition <span class = \"strong\">between</span> to describe something in the middle of two things.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Preposition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in Wiltshire\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\