, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn4le07ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hmm ... what's that banner say? The San Francisco Festival of India is coming!  That's the celebration of Indian heritage and culture. I wonder where it's happening. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Excuse me, Miss? Are you going to attend our festival?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I would like to. What can I do there?", "id": 1, "time": "0500", "image": "engenn4le07ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Attendees can enjoy a parade, a film festival, an arts and crafts bazaar, a bevy of yummy food options and much more.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sounds great! Where is it?<br />", "id": 2, "time": "18700", "image": "engenn4le07ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: It takes place at the park behind City Hall.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How do I get there from here?", "id": 3, "time": "30500", "image": "engenn4le07ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: You see where the florist is?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Make a right at that corner. Walk towards the bakery. Go past the bookstore. Walk under the banner. Then, cross the bridge.", "id": 4, "time": "35750", "image": "engenn4le07ob03re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le07ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le07ob03re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}